  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 602.01 Transporter Registration Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 602.01 Transporter Registration Requirements. No person shall transport hazardous waste into or within the state of New Hampshire without having a transporter registration issued by the department in accordance with Env-Hw 609.\n\nSource. #5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 600) ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12348, eff 8-14-17; ss by #12922, eff 11-23-19 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 600)",
